      "comment": "BELL-DRIVEN: buys only when the MARKET bell has tolled (a market peal opens trading). An armed resident who wants the good and can afford the ask buys one unit from an OPEN (exotic) stall with stock. The trader is the SOLE source; coin leaves the closed economy OUT to the external trader (external_outflux logs it). One unit per arming (buy_armed->0).",
